@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> escrowCreated : create from accepted order

escrowCreated --> funded : mark funding reserved
escrowCreated --> onHold : operational hold
escrowCreated --> disputeOpen : dispute raised
escrowCreated --> cancelled : cancel/expire before funding

funded --> releaseRequested : release requested after evidence check
funded --> onHold : operational hold
funded --> disputeOpen : dispute raised
funded --> expired : timeout

releaseRequested --> settlementInstructionReady : approve release
releaseRequested --> releaseRejected : reject release
releaseRequested --> onHold : hold for review
releaseRequested --> disputeOpen : dispute raised

releaseRejected --> funded : remediate evidence
onHold --> releaseRequested : resume after review
onHold --> disputeOpen : escalate dispute
onHold --> cancelled : cancel after review

disputeOpen --> arbitration : arbitration accepted
arbitration --> settlementInstructionReady : approveRelease decision
arbitration --> refunded : refund decision
arbitration --> cancelled : cancel decision

settlementInstructionReady --> released : sandbox/manual payment settled
settlementInstructionReady --> onHold : payment exception

released --> [*]
refunded --> [*]
cancelled --> [*]
expired --> [*]

note right of settlementInstructionReady
No real bank payment is implied.
Payment adapters must reconcile status
before terminal settlement claims.
end note
@enduml
